cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Fable in your work, please cite it using this metadata.
type: software
title: "Fable: F# to JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, Rust, Erlang and Dart compiler"
abstract: Fable compiles F# to JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, Rust, Dart and Erlang/BEAM. It is built on the F# Compiler Services and ships runtime libraries for each target, so F# code can run natively in those ecosystems.
